 **Parameters:**
-* Baseline Processing: Evaluations may process the ground truth map with a Gaussian blur kernel of size $9 \times 9 \times 9$ voxels and $\sigma = 4/3$ [S1].
+- `baseline`: In some evaluations, a baseline map processed with a Gaussian blur kernel (size $9 \times 9 \times 9$ voxels, $\sigma=4/3$) is used to compute ATE [S1].
 
